        <tr> 
          <td valign="top"> 
            <div align="center"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="5" color="#333333">News</font><br>
            </div>
            <hr>
            <font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#333333">Monday, 
            September 17th 2001<br>
            </font> 
            <hr>
            <font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#333333"></font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td valign="top"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">Derakor 
            the Vindicator slain!<br>
            Was a picture perfect almost flawless kill. Only a couple people died 
            due to enrage / not wanting to take faction hit.<br>
            <br>
            <img src="SS/vindi.jpg" width="800" height="419"><br>
            <br>
            Contrats to Omol on breastplate, and Neafy on the head.<br>
            <br>
            In other news, contrats to Soulburn on completing his epic!<br>
            <br>
            <img src="SS/soul_epic.jpg" width="142" height="379"> <br>
            <br>
            We also wacked VS today. Congrats to Ortin and Timarak on their new 
            legs! </font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td valign="top"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2"></font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td valign="top"> 
            <div align="center"><br>
            </div>
            <hr>
            <font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#333333">Sunday</font><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#333333">, 
            September 16th 2001<br>
            </font> 
            <hr>
            <font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#333333"> 
            </font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td> 
            <table width="800" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3">
              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td colspan="2"><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Time 
                  for a long overdue update. I'll try to remember it all, but 
                  if I'm missing something you all have permission to shove me 
                  up against a wall and stone me to death :)<br>
                  <br>
                  We spend this weekend in ToV farming some more armor. A grand 
                  total of 62 pieces over 2 days. Congrats to all the winners!</font></td>
              </tr>
              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td colspan="2"><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><img src="SS/postTOV_group.jpg" width="502" height="326"><br>
                  Here is Grummpy and Denuvien showing off their new breastplates, 
                  and Aelori, Malik, and Noki sporting some new legs.<br>
                  </font></td>
              </tr>
              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><img src="SS/ortin_helm.jpg" width="360" height="276"><br>
                  Ortin got a scarry looking helm :)</font></td>
                <td><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><img src="SS/wall_legs.jpg" width="360" height="276"><br>
                  Wally also picked up some legs. Gotta love that full warlord 
                  look.</font></td>
              </tr>
              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"></font></td>
                <td><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"></font></td>
              </tr>
              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><img src="SS/ment_60.jpg" width="359" height="221"><br>
                  Everyones favorate gnome cleric turned 60! Grats Menty!</font></td>
                <td><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><img src="SS/lanee_epic.jpg" width="135" height="286"><br>
                  Lanee picked up a new bic lighter :)</font></td>
              </tr>
              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"></font></td>
                <td><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"></font></td>
              </tr>
              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td colspan="2"> <br>
                  <ul>
                    <li><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">After 
                      a month of clearing Myga PH's in WW, Bromil got his Dragonbane 
                      spell!</font></li>
                    <li><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">After 
                      about 10,000 Hate trips Soulburn finally got his mage staff!</font></li>
                    <li><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Killed 
                      Trak. - Ranger and SK breastplates. Only a handfull of teeth 
                      left to get.</font></li>
                    <li><font size="2" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Killed 
                      Gore - She didn't cough up a scale this time. Back on the 
                      hitlist she goes.</font></li>
                  </ul>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
